  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 cup shortening",
    "2 eggs",
    "4 tablespoons red food coloring",
    "2 tablespoons cocoa",
    "1 cup buttermilk",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2.5 cups sifted all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon distilled white vinegar",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking soda",
    "1 cup milk",
    "5 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 cup butter, room temperature",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease two 9-inch round pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cake: Beat 1 1/2 cups sugar and shortening together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Combine red food coloring and cocoa to make a paste; add to creamed mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Umbm-LZmYp0ZXUCgGka9QyVvOG8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-02-02dd0bc81f1d40719d719c3f7df3742a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix buttermilk, salt, and 1 teaspoon vanilla together in a small bowl. Add flour, alternating with buttermilk mixture, mixing just until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TLx3x9R9tFbWsbsbfNhQwTCZUBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-03-54d1d1ca167f454a8c77e8af80f8c605.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix vinegar and baking soda together; gently fold into cake batter and pour into prepared pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l9VR0lZBZn5WHH75kA5C5qKehSU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-04-c5d1a67cd36442a9b76eb832c2ca7e95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 30 minutes. Cool on a wire rack for 5 minutes. Run a table knife around the edges to loosen. Invert carefully onto a serving plate or cooling rack. Let cool, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RACM6OnxwDA8SOMTHYjKvRZMu-c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-05a-43751b7d35374136968b5d4e3a5b6cdb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the icing: Heat milk and flour in a saucepan over low heat, stirring constantly, until thick. Set aside to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_W5BJ9SoxybzYsz8fgYhImLo4j4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-06-80cbf26030f347c08081489998bf1e17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, beat sugar, butter, and vanilla together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Add cooled flour mixture and beat until frosting is a good spreading consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/msPeYrjKMuy-kgUmogr8CRWiJus=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-07-ca9ead0452274cd8a73b64066d512898.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost cake layers when completely cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nCvYYMrgmbbGK1tM988M_kCiMAA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-step-08-1bd611db3c9d46ffb4368be58cf3c167.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J3DMZMDyTCCwzu_s1VxVl_XzQtM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9295-red-velvet-cake-PICS-Beauty-4x3-aa599cd6e20942bf911db50767125fd4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9295/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
